st in Mr. Mikes Leather Seat Covers.<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>NO problem with that in my Fiero, since all girls hate it.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Wow, that's a first.  All the girls I meet seem to love sports cars...most aren't as happy with the ride of my 17" wheels and lowered fiero, but it only has to get you to a hidden spot.<P>------------------<BR>Cameron<BR> <A HREF="http://Fiero.NetMARC.com" TARGET=_blank>http://Fiero.NetMARC.com</A> <p>[This message has been edited by Cameron (edited 04-24-2001).]||||reg||1
